author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rust-crash-harness
resolution: "PR #116 merged at 2026-10-25T15:43:39Z: Observed Node terminal events determine passed/failed/not_run; subset, skip, todo, absent and duplicate events cannot certify omitted checks. The re-recorded oracle receipt has 33 expected/executed/passed and zero failed/not_run; the fresh-clone gate validates durable main/evidence-branch retention across JSON and Markdown receipts. The six regressions exercise subset refusal and retention. Published crash divergence and the separate local deadline follow-up remain open; full crash conformance is not claimed."
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria and the declared audit scope are proven on current main, with explicit SDK and broader-project boundaries."
actual_result: "Verified current main contains merged PR #116 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/116), merge commit dc8d894d5d6feb597a33872aaed87a6249afadac, merged_at 2026-10-25T15:43:39Z. Inspected scripts/crash-proof-results.mts, scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.test.mts and docs/CRASH_ORACLE_2026_10_25.json. Observed Node terminal events determine passed/failed/not_run; subset, skip, todo, absent and duplicate events cannot certify omitted checks. The re-recorded oracle receipt has 33 expected/executed/passed and zero failed/not_run; the fresh-clone gate validates durable main/evidence-branch retention across JSON and Markdown receipts. The six regressions exercise subset refusal and retention. Published crash divergence and the separate local deadline follow-up remain open; full crash conformance is not claimed. Linked focused verification passed: node --test scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts scripts/crash-evidence-commits.test.mts. No product source behavior changed in this closure branch. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI; no new behavioral revert applies to tracker-only changes."
comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T14:20:44.804Z",codex-agent,"Confirmed the old filter selected only two live return cases while the receipt asserted all eight. Plan: parse Node test events, name every mutation check, require complete execution, test subset refusal and behavioral revert, and add a fresh remote clone evidence-commit gate. Historical review source is preserved on evidence/crash-review-2026-10-23. Dependency pins remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T14:27:59.151Z",codex-agent,"Implemented observed Node terminal events and 33 named expectations (24 real-state mutations, 8 live mutations, 1 phase regression). Subset certification reports missing checks as not_run. The fresh-clone gate also found historical benchmark sources lost after squash merges; preserved their existing commits on four evidence branches without rewriting receipts or creating tags. Gate currently resolves 34 references across 19 receipts."
  "2026-10-25T14:28:41.551Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replaced only reconcileResults observation lookup with hard-coded passed, ran node --test --test-reporter=tap scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts: exit 1, 1 passed and 2 failed; restored original bytes and reran: exit 0, 3 passed. Independently omitted only evidence commit resolution/retention validation: evidence suite exit 1, 2 passed and 1 failed; restored: exit 0, 3 passed. No history was rewritten."
  "2026-10-25T14:29:18.388Z",codex-agent,"Real subset run with the original live return delete-item/truncate-event filter: runner exit 0, recorder exit 1; expected 33, executed/passed 2, not_run 31, including all six omitted live checks. Typecheck and ESLint pass. Linked regression run through pm test passed all 6 tests; tracking is disabled by project policy, so results are documented here."
  "2026-10-25T14:38:50.750Z",codex-agent,"Re-recorded docs/CRASH_ORACLE_2026_10_25.json from a complete real run at preserved source 02ab410: 33 expected, 33 executed and passed, 0 failed or not_run (24 real-state mutations, 8 live mutations, 1 phase check). Exact-state revert observed 24 failed and 8 passed; restored 32 passed. Phase revert failed 1; restored passed 1. Public copy: 26 measured kills, 24 passing cases, 10/20 passing phase pairs, 2 retained reproductions, 86 source items unchanged. Published divergence remains a measured failure, not certification. Source hash validation uses the preserved commit, so subsequent documentation-only edits do not invalidate historical evidence."
  "2026-10-25T14:50:06.645Z",codex-agent,"Extended the remote retention gate to Markdown receipts in docs/evidence as well as structured JSON docs; regression covers receipt/line failure labels and excludes longer content hashes. Fresh clone now resolves 36 references across 20 receipts, including the native-adapter source already on main. All 3 evidence regressions, strict TypeScript and ESLint pass. Clean-HOME npm aggregate is running; no implementation or threshold changes are planned."
  "2026-10-25T14:55:47.506Z",codex-agent,"Clean-HOME npm run release:check exited 101 after 16 Rust suites: 531 passed, 1 failed, 0 ignored. The unchanged relationship_large_edge_limit_finishes_at_budget_floor test exceeded the existing five-second native child deadline (no exit code versus expected 2), matching the already tracked pm-rust-local-packet-deadline signature. Aggregate stages after that failure did not run and are not claimed. Running just crash-check separately, then Bun aggregate; no deadline or orientation code changed."
  "2026-10-25T14:58:49.100Z",codex-agent,"Standalone just crash-check passed: strict TypeScript, ESLint, 82 tests passed with 0 failed/skipped/cancelled/todo, byte-prefix history gate (1 existing stream checked and 1 branch-only stream), and fresh full remote clone verification (36 references across 20 receipts). This separately verifies all crash checks despite the unrelated npm aggregate deadline failure. Bun aggregate is now running."
  "2026-10-25T15:12:04.566Z",codex-agent,"Implementation and evidence are ready for review. npm (clean HOME, no global Git config) and Bun release aggregates each exited 101 with 531 passed, 1 failed, 0 ignored across 16 completed Rust suites at the existing pm-rust-local-packet-deadline failure; later aggregate stages did not run and are not claimed. Standalone just crash-check passed 82/82, strict typecheck, ESLint, history-prefix validation, and all 36 commit references across 20 receipts. Targeted Rust identity and release-pipeline contracts passed 7 and 20 tests. Frozen source 02ab410 remains on its evidence branch. Releasing the claim for orchestrator review without closing either item; exact-head CI results will be attached to the PR description."
  "2026-10-26T08:22:38.678Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #116 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/116), merge commit dc8d894d5d6feb597a33872aaed87a6249afadac, merged_at 2026-10-25T15:43:39Z. Inspected scripts/crash-proof-results.mts, scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.test.mts and docs/CRASH_ORACLE_2026_10_25.json. Observed Node terminal events determine passed/failed/not_run; subset, skip, todo, absent and duplicate events cannot certify omitted checks. The re-recorded oracle receipt has 33 expected/executed/passed and zero failed/not_run; the fresh-clone gate validates durable main/evidence-branch retention across JSON and Markdown receipts. The six regressions exercise subset refusal and retention. Published crash divergence and the separate local deadline follow-up remain open; full crash conformance is not claimed. Plan: run the linked focused verification on unchanged main sources; append only tracker evidence, regenerate the repository changelog and submit a closure PR for full CI."
  "2026-10-26T08:27:15.021Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #116 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/116), merge commit dc8d894d5d6feb597a33872aaed87a6249afadac, merged_at 2026-10-25T15:43:39Z. Inspected scripts/crash-proof-results.mts, scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.mts, scripts/crash-evidence-commits.test.mts and docs/CRASH_ORACLE_2026_10_25.json. Observed Node terminal events determine passed/failed/not_run; subset, skip, todo, absent and duplicate events cannot certify omitted checks. The re-recorded oracle receipt has 33 expected/executed/passed and zero failed/not_run; the fresh-clone gate validates durable main/evidence-branch retention across JSON and Markdown receipts. The six regressions exercise subset refusal and retention. Published crash divergence and the separate local deadline follow-up remain open; full crash conformance is not claimed. Linked focused verification passed: node --test scripts/crash-proof-results.test.mts scripts/crash-evidence-commits.test.mts. No product source behavior changed in this closure branch. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI; no new behavioral revert applies to tracker-only changes."
  "2026-10-26T08:27:52.709Z",codex-agent,"Verification boundary: an initial linked --only-last selection ran the pre-existing broad just crash-check instead of the duplicated recorder command. It reported 65/82 passing and 17 failures; process traces include child exit 127 under this unprepared local runtime. That run is failed evidence, not crash certification. Selecting the inspected recorder command explicitly with --match passed all 6/6 tests with zero skips. This tracker-only sweep makes no claim that the broad local crash suite passed; exact-head PR CI owns native runtime setup and the full release gates."
  "2026-10-26T08:29:34.815Z",codex-agent,"Health boundary: full pinned health reproduces the existing pm-rust-b4yl chain mismatches in pm-rust-bj7a and pm-rust-unih. Both original item/history pairs are unchanged by this branch and their existing open investigation is preserved. Clone-local pinned merge drivers are installed for the repository CI health command; check-only strict health is a separate gate and cannot establish integrity of those older chains. No history repair, re-anchoring, dependency change or telemetry-configuration change is included."
